WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.940
And I’m a very, very spiritual person.

2
00:00:03.940 --> 00:00:08.900
I feel that this world was given to us as stewards,

3
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:15.820
for us to take care of, and we’re not the ones that should be destroying it.

4
00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:20.220
I have a very strong belief in God, and this was God’s message to me:

5
00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:25.140
that you don’t tear up My Earth, it was given to you.
